        <title type="html"><![CDATA[[WebExtensions] Add data for runtime.getVersion() method]]></title>
        <id>https://github.com/mdn/browser-compat-data/pull/28942</id>
        <link href="https://github.com/mdn/browser-compat-data/pull/28942"/>
        <updated>2026-01-29T18:48:09.000Z</updated>
        <content type="html"><![CDATA[<img src="https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/45960703?v=4" width="64" height="64" alt=""/><br/>
<h4 dir="auto">Summary</h4>

<p dir="auto">Add data for the new runtime.getVersion() method, supported on Chrome 143+,[1] Safari 26.2.[2][3] Firefox does not support it yet.[4]</p>
<p dir="auto">This method was created in W3C WECG as a standard way to access extension version, and an alternative to implementation-dependent <code class="notranslate">runtime.getManifest().version</code>.[5][6]</p>
<h4 dir="auto">Test results and supporting details</h4>


<p dir="auto">Sources:<br>
[1] <a href="https://developer.chrome.com/docs/extensions/reference/api/runtime#method-getVersion" rel="nofollow">https://developer.chrome.com/docs/extensions/reference/api/runtime#method-getVersion</a><br>
[2] <a href="https://developer.apple.com/documentation/safari-release-notes/safari-26_2-release-notes" rel="nofollow">https://developer.apple.com/documentation/safari-release-notes/safari-26_2-release-notes</a><br>
[3] <a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="3481883150" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/WebKit/WebKit/issues/51763" data-hovercard-type="pull_request" data-hovercard-url="/WebKit/WebKit/pull/51763/hovercard" href="https://github.com/WebKit/WebKit/pull/51763">WebKit/WebKit#51763</a><br>
[4] <a href="https://bugzilla.mozilla.org/show_bug.cgi?id=1992418" rel="nofollow">https://bugzilla.mozilla.org/show_bug.cgi?id=1992418</a><br>
[5] <a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="3465982582" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/w3c/webextensions/issues/878" data-hovercard-type="issue" data-hovercard-url="/w3c/webextensions/issues/878/hovercard" href="https://github.com/w3c/webextensions/issues/878">w3c/webextensions#878</a><br>
[6] <a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="1735060999" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/w3c/webextensions/issues/400" data-hovercard-type="issue" data-hovercard-url="/w3c/webextensions/issues/400/hovercard" href="https://github.com/w3c/webextensions/issues/400">w3c/webextensions#400</a></p>
<p dir="auto">I tested the following code in debug console:</p>
<div class="highlight highlight-source-js notranslate position-relative overflow-auto" dir="auto" data-snippet-clipboard-copy-content="chrome.runtime.getVersion()"><pre class="notranslate"><span class="pl-s1">chrome</span><span class="pl-kos">.</span><span class="pl-c1">runtime</span><span class="pl-kos">.</span><span class="pl-en">getVersion</span><span class="pl-kos">(</span><span class="pl-kos">)</span></pre></div>
<p dir="auto">Method exists on Chrome 144.0.7559.98.<br>
Method does not exist on Firefox 146.0.1 and 147.0.2.</p>
<h4 dir="auto">Related issues</h4>
<p dir="auto">Companion content PR: <a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="3871286416" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/mdn/content/issues/42971" data-hovercard-type="pull_request" data-hovercard-url="/mdn/content/pull/42971/hovercard" href="https://github.com/mdn/content/pull/42971">mdn/content#42971</a></p>

]]></content>
